  {
    "name": "FAQ",
    "settings": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Default questions shown by every FAQ that has no questions of its own."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_1_q",
        "label": "Question 1",
        "default": "Is the Tredvik Knee Sleeve suitable for everyday use?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_1_a",
        "label": "Answer 1",
        "default": "<p>Yes. The Tredvik Knee Sleeve was specifically designed for everyday activities such as walking, working, climbing stairs, or standing for long periods of time.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_2_q",
        "label": "Question 2",
        "default": "Can I adjust the compression myself?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_2_a",
        "label": "Answer 2",
        "default": "<p>Yes. With the built-in precision dial, you can adjust the compression to your liking—depending on how much support feels comfortable.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_3_q",
        "label": "Question 3",
        "default": "Does the sleeve slip when you walk?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_3_a",
        "label": "Answer 3",
        "default": "<p>The Tredvik Knee Sleeve features a non-slip silicone grip designed to help reduce slipping and rolling.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_4_q",
        "label": "Question 4",
        "default": "Can I wear the sleeve under my clothes?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_4_a",
        "label": "Answer 4",
        "default": "<p>Yes. Its flexible and compact design ensures that the bandage can be worn comfortably under most everyday clothing.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_5_q",
        "label": "Question 5",
        "default": "Is the knee brace suitable for both knees?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_5_a",
        "label": "Answer 5",
        "default": "<p>Yes. The Tredvik Knee Sleeve can be worn on either the left or right knee.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_6_q",
        "label": "Question 6",
        "default": "Is there a money-back guarantee if the Tredvik Knee Sleeve doesn't work?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_6_a",
        "label": "Answer 6",
        "default": "<p>We offer a satisfaction guarantee! If you are not satisfied with the Tredvik Knee Seeve, please contact us at {{CompanyEmail}} for a return and refund within 99 days.</p><p>The period begins upon receipt of the product. It is important to us to support you as best as possible in your daily life. Therefore, we recommend wearing the Tredvik Knee Sleeve daily for 2 weeks before making a final decision.</p>"
      }
    ]
  },
